{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The smaller core removes the candidate-set starvation and UDP-cookie work from the first milestone. Two issues still need design changes: different principals can share a candidate load that either follower may abandon, and the fixed board name still conflicts with the logical stream identity contract. The security text also needs to distinguish replay below the installed floor from replay that remains eligible and can repeatedly replace an unfinished candidate."}}
