}])\n   675\t\n   676\t            ::dht-module-status\n   677\t            [node {:ok (host-status (linker.dht/module-status node manifest))}]\n   678\t\n   679\t            ::dht-retry\n   680\t            (publication-call node manifest dht/retry! :retrying)\n   808\t   be re-read.  A value that is not a request envelope is consumed\n   809\t   unanswered: no call made it.  A `dao.space.dht` call is answered from\n   810\t   `dht`, the shell's DHT node, which a `load-index` advances.  A\n   811\t   `yin.link` call is answered from `dht` and `indexer` under `link`, the\n   812\t   session composition `link-answer` reads; a publish advances both.\n   813\t   Returns `{:pair pair :dht node :indexer indexer :progress? bool\n   814\t   :answered n}`, `n` the responses appended.\"\n   815\t  [{:keys [pair indexer ast-indexer dht limits budget link]}]\n   816\t  (loop [pair pair\n   817\t         node dht\n   818\t         indexer indexer\n   819\t         remaining budget\n   820\t         progress? false\n   821\t         answered 0]\n   822\t    (let [r (when (pos? remaining)\n   823\t              (stream/next (:call-in pair) (:cursor pair)))\n   824\t          done (fn [pair node indexer progress? answered]\n   825\t                 {:pair pair, :dht node, :indexer indexer,\n   826\t                  :progress? progress?, :answered answered})]\n   827\t      (if-not (= :dao.stream/ok (:dao.stream/outcome r))\n   828\t        (done pair node indexer progress? answered)\n   829\t        (let [request (:dao.stream/value r)\n   830\t              [node' indexer' response]\n   831\t              (cond\n   832\t                (not (apply2/request? request)) [node indexer nil]\n   833\t                (dht-op? request) (let [[n response] (dht-answer node limits request)]\n   834\t                                    [n indexer response])\n   835\t                (link-op? request) (link-answer node indexer link request)\n   836\t                :else [node indexer (answer